<title><![CDATA[Meet the 3X3: Raised between the forests of Vancouver Island and...]]></title>
<link>https://picnob.com/post/6760683741146749364762</link>
<guid>https://picnob.com/post/6760683741146749364762</guid>
<description>
<![CDATA[
Meet the 3X3: Raised between the forests of Vancouver Island and the rigor of classical conservatory training, @elysiabiro has built a career defined by technical command and stylistic fluidity. A Royal Conservatory of Toronto graduate who went on to earn both a Bachelor of Music in Jazz Studies and a Master’s at the niversity of York, she has already been signed to both niversal Music Canada and Deutsche Grammophon, an uncommon duality that signals crossover ambition at a global level.Biro’s growing digital reach, shaped by viral performances and jazz transcription content, has positioned her among a new generation redefining how virtuosic musicianship circulates online.Meet the rest of the Class of 6 online at glory.media.<p><img src="https://prank-arum.github.io/Feeds/Instagram/elysiabiro/6760683741146749364762.jpg">]]>
</description>
